  (2, 'treat', 'tri:t', 'n. 宴请, 款待；vt. 视为, 对待, 论述, 治疗, 款待；vi. 讨论, 谈判, 作东', '来源：ECDICT 开源词库', 'n. an occurrence that causes special pleasure or delight；v. interact in a certain way；v. provide treatment for；v. provide with a gift or entertainment', '', 'n. 宴请, 款待；vt. 视为, 对待, 论述, 治疗, 款待；vi. 讨论, 谈判, 作东', 'CET-6词库'),
